{"shortDescription":"Asia's diesel markets surged on Friday, with trading sentiment firmer in the latter half of the week due to rising prices in the West and persistent global supply concerns, though window spot deals were scant.The front-month east-west price spreads eased slightly from a week earlier, taking into ac…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Asia's diesel markets surged on Friday, with trading sentiment firmer in the latter half of the week due to rising prices in the West and persistent global supply concerns, though window spot deals were scant."]},{"type":"p","children":["The front-month east-west price spreads eased slightly from a week earlier, taking into account a rollover in assessment months, closing at discounts of around $125 per metric ton on Friday."]},{"type":"p","children":["Some October refiner sales have begun, although the bulk of discussions should start next week when refiners get more clarity on their production runs."]},{"type":"p","children":["Refining margins (GO10SGCKMc1) shot back up to their highest since end-March to around $83.5 a barrel."]},{"type":"p","children":["Cash differentials (GO10-SIN-DIF) also jumped back up to slightly more than $4 a barrel, holding steady from last week's levels."]},{"type":"p","children":["In jet fuel markets, timespreads and cash differentials both bounced back, reversing most of the previous sessions' decline, with the arbitrage margins to Europe still remaining firm."]},{"type":"p","children":["Regrade (JETREG10SGMc1) jumped back up to premiums of nearly $2 a barrel."]},{"type":"p","children":["SINGAPORE CASH DEALS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- No deal for jet or gasoil"]},{"type":"p","children":["INVENTORIES"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Gasoil stocks independently held in the Amsterdam-Rotterdam-Antwerp (ARA) refining and storage hub rose by 4% on the week, data from Dutch consultancy Insights Global showed on Thursday."]},{"type":"p","children":["REFINERY NEWS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Marathon Petroleum was restarting the residual hydrotreater at its 631,000-barrels-per-day Galveston Bay Refinery in Texas City, Texas on Thursday, said people familiar with plant operations."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Russia's Rosneft-owned Ryazan oil refinery stopped operations following the September 6 drone attack, two industry sources told Reuters on Thursday."]},{"type":"p","children":["NEWS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- The U.S. national average price of diesel on Thursday surpassed $6 a gallon for the first time ever, according to price tracker GasBuddy, as the U.S.-Israeli war on Iran and Ukrainian attacks on Russia's refineries have squeezed supply."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Oil prices fell on Friday but both major benchmarks are on track to end the week above $100 a barrel for the first time since mid-May, as increasing attacks along key shipping routes in the Middle East fuel fears of a prolonged disruption to supplies."]},{"type":"p","children":["- China has capped increases in retail prices for transportation fuels for the third time since the Iran war began to mitigate the impact of rising international oil prices on the domestic market, the state planner said in a statement on Friday."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Global oil supply and demand will fall further than previously thought this year, the International Energy Agency said on Friday, as a lack of progress in resolving the U.S.-Iran war delays the return of normal Middle East flows into 2027 and boosts fuel prices."]},{"type":"p","children":["PRICES"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["MIDDLE DISTILLATES"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","